xy refuses a raw IP) and the CPU, memory and disk limits. `CheckWorkspacePath` decides whether a folder may become a workspace (issue #90): an existing empty directory strictly below a workspace root, resolved and compared by identity, and not inside a git repository, because a human's own repository is never mounted. `whr serve` validates all of it at start and reports every problem with its key. The full onboarding stays in #29.
 
